<title>USA: Global Environmental holder files 13D.</title>
<headline>Global Environmental holder files 13D.</headline>
<dateline>HAGERSTON, Md. 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global Environmental Corp said on Friday Richard Snyder of Texas filed a 13D form to show he now owned over five percent of the company.</p>
<p>He bought one million shares directly from the company, and also owned convertible preferred stock, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
